-stage sequential progression for Chapters 2 & 4, 3 concurrent heist prep tracks for Chapter 3, verified Ending A/B payout details, and a dedicated fact-checking reference section.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Grand Theft Auto VI: Campaign Mission Flow & Prerequisite Guide\\n\\nThis document provides the definitive mission dependency graph, prerequisite unlock trees, character-switching milestones, heist setup pipelines, points of no return, and speedrun routing across all 5 story chapters of *Grand Theft Auto VI*.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. High-Level Campaign Architecture\\n\\nThe GTA VI storyline progresses through five distinct geographical and thematic narrative blocks. While open-world exploration is available between operations, missions operate in a strict Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) with key narrative bottlenecks connecting each chapter.\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart TD\\n    subgraph C1B[\\\"Prologue & Chapter 1\\\"]\\n        C1[\\\"Just Like Paradise<br/>(Leonida Keys & Key Lento)<br/>Missions 1 - 18\\\"]\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph C2B[\\\"Chapter 2\\\"]\\n        C2[\\\"Paradise Lost<br/>(Port Gellhorn & Kelly County)<br/>Missions 23 - 44\\\"]\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph C3B[\\\"Chapter 3\\\"]\\n        C3[\\\"Vice City Syndicate Expansion<br/>(Vice City Metro & Sinfrontera Heist)<br/>Missions 45 - 70\\\"]\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph C4B[\\\"Chapter 4\\\"]\\n        C4[\\\"Vice City Metro & Airport Takedown<br/>(Ocean Beach & VCIA Cargo Heist)<br/>Missions 71 - 95\\\"]\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph C5B[\\\"Chapter 5\\\"]\\n        C5[\\\"Top of the World, Ma!<br/>(Climax, Standoff & Branching Endings)<br/>Missions 96 - 102\\\"]\\n    end\\n\\n    C1 -->|\\\"Bottleneck: Doin' Gone\\\"| C2\\n    C2 -->|\\\"Bottleneck: Checking Out\\\"| C3\\n    C3 -->|\\\"Bottleneck: The Cartel Heist\\\"| C4\\n    C4 -->|\\\"Point of No Return: Sunset\\\"| C5\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise (Leonida Keys)\\n\\n### Mechanics & Structure\\n- **Playable Character**: Strictly locked to **Jason** (with Lucia introduced in the Prologue and reunited in *\\\"Coming Home\\\"*).\\n- **Core Narrative**: Petty smuggling, local debt enforcement for Brian, and settling in Key Lento following Lucia's release from Hamlet State Penitentiary.\\n- **True 3-Branch Parallel Architecture**: After completing *\\\"Gone Fishing\\\"* ($140\n<truncated 25801 bytes>","Description":"\"Comprehensive updated mission flow chart and prerequisite guide for GTA VI with verified 3-branch Chapter 1 structure, decision diamonds, 4 sequential stages for Chapters 2 and 4, concurrent heist preps, and ground-truth fact checking.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\Downloads\\\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\\\gta6_mission_flow_chart.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing updated mission flowchart markdown\"","toolSummary":"\"Update mission flow chart markdown\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
