{"step_index":464,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T00:00:03Z","content":"All discrepancies, layout collisions, and line-crossing errors have been resolved. The mission dependency graphs, high-resolution visual flowcharts, and technical documentation are updated and synchronized.\n\n---\n\n### Key Revisions & Ground-Truth Alignments\n\n1. **Chapter 1 True 3-Parallel Branch Structure (Matching Reference `image_1188e9.jpg`)**:\n   - Replaced the forced 4-column linear sequence with the true 3-branch parallel Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) branching off *Gone Fishing* ($140 mailbox):\n     - **Branch 1 (Cal & Brian Marina Jobs)**: *Unwanted Attention* ($200 mailbox) $\\rightarrow$ *Pipework*.\n     - **Branch 2 (Brian Armory & Gate)**: *Gear Up* $\\rightarrow$ *Just a Scratch* (Ganado Respray; **Mandatory Gate**).\n     - **Branch 3 (Main Spine)**: *Lab Fees* $\\rightarrow$ *Hey Arnold!* $\\rightarrow$ *Feng Shui* (24h wait) $\\rightarrow$ *Coming Home* (Lucia released) $\\rightarrow$ *Find Donnie's Package*.\n   - **Decision Diamond 1**: Checks *Just a Scratch* before *Buck Me*. If skipped, Joey calls Jason to reroute him.\n   - **Decision Diamond 2**: Checks that *both* *Day Release* and *Just a Scratch* are completed before unlocking *Swamped*.\n   - **Corrected Chapter 1 Climax**: Corrected the community typo \"Don Gone\" to **\"Doin' Gone\"** (clearing Donnie's trailer) and terminated Chapter 1 cleanly there. Removed speculative missions 19–22 (*Recalibration*, *Tourist Trap*, *Home Sweet Home*, *Discharge Time*).\n\n2. **Clean Orthogonal Gutter Routing in Chapters 2 & 4**:\n   - Eliminated diagonal wrap-around arrows that previously made sequential chapters look like parallel faction branches.\n   - Structured Chapters 2 and 4 into **4 distinct sequential stages** (Stages 1–4) connected by non-crossing orthogonal perimeter bridges routed through the column gutters with stage indicator badges (`STAGE 2 ▲ NEXT`, etc.).\n\n3. **Chapter 3 Heist Preparation Distribution Bus**:\n   - Replaced diagonal vectors from *61. Sinfrontera National Bank* with an overhead horizontal **top distribution bus bar** spanning acr\n<truncated 553 bytes>\nfirmed that the $2M in the game script is the **mission reward cash payout** awarded to Jason and Lucia for surviving the Coast Guard gauntlet, **not** an entry requirement to start the mission.\n   - **Any% Speedrun Optimal Ending**: **Ending B (*The Deal*)** accepts federal immunity, completely skipping the multi-stage offshore gunboat battle and saving **8 to 12 minutes**.\n   - **Chapter 4 Abe Gonzalez Cash Gate**: Runners must retain at least **$75,000** from the Sinfrontera Heist ($10.5M take) to clear the *Party Hard* wire transfer gate without grinding.\n\n---\n\n### Deliverables & Clickable Links\n\n#### Visual Flowcharts (PNG)\n- **Chapter 1 Ground-Truth Speedrun Map**: [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png)\n- **Full Campaign Any% Speedrun Master**: [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png)\n- **Chapter 1 Detailed Chart**: [flowchart_chapter_1.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/flowchart_chapter_1.png)\n- **Chapter 2 (4 Sequential Stages)**: [flowchart_chapter_2.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/flowchart_chapter_2.png)\n- **Chapter 3 (3 Strands & Heist Bus)**: [flowchart_chapter_3.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/flowchart_chapter_3.png)\n- **Chapter 4 (4 Sequential Stages & VCIA Heist)**: [flowchart_chapter_4.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/flowchart_chapter_4.png)\n- **Chapter 5 (Finale, Standoff & Endings)**: [flowchart_chapter_5.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/flowchart_chapter_5.png)\n- **Unified Master Campaign Flowchart**: [flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png)\n\n#### Markdown Specification & Speedrun Guide\n- **Complete Mission Flow & Unlock Guide**: [gta6_mission_flow_chart.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md)\n  *(Also mirrored at [Downloads/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md))*","thinking":"The files confirm the generation of a speedrunning visual guide for Grand Theft Auto VI, specifically covering Chapter 1 with parallel tracks, decision points, and visual elements such as mailboxes and text details. A complete campaign routing map is also generated. The output includes a flowchart for Chapter 1 with a 'True' state.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
